I now have a rented racket in my hand.
I walk to the court with it.
There are three people standing there.
They look at me and smile.
One woman among them waves her hand at me.
I go near them.
"Hello, my name is Sara," she says.
"This is Kiran, this is Vishnu," Sara introduces them.
I happily say my name.
"Hello, my name is Maya," I say.
"Are you coming to play?" Kiran asks.
"Yes, I like to play badminton," I say.
"We are going to play a doubles game," Sara says.
"We need one more person," Vishnu says.
"Can you play with us?" Vishnu asks.
"Sure, I can play," I reply.
I really like to meet new people.
I go to the court to play with them.
